error[E0310]: `?` needs an Option or a Result, found i64
 --> tests/errors/E0310_try.al:4:18
  |
4 |     let v: i64 = n?;
  |                  ^^
  = hint: `?` takes the value out of an Option.Some or a Result.Ok, and returns an Option.None or Result.Err

error[E0310]: `?` on an Option returns its Option.None, but `plain` returns i64
 --> tests/errors/E0310_try.al:9:12
  |
9 |     return parse_i64(s)?;
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = hint: make `plain` return an Option, or handle the None: unwrap_or(parse_i64(s), default), or if let Option.Some(v) = parse_i64(s) { }

